        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Form 1120-S (2025) Page 5 - Schedule M-1 and M-2</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #000;\n    margin: 20px 40px;\n  }\n  .top-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #000;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .schedule-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .schedule-label {\n    background: #000;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    margin-right: 14px;\n  }\n  .schedule-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .schedule-note {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  hr.section-line {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1.5px solid #000;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  /* Schedule M-1 layout */\n  .m1-table {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 25px 1fr 90px 25px 1fr 90px;\n    column-gap: 6px;\n    row-gap: 4px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .m1-table .num {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .m1-table .letter {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-right: 4px;\n  }\n  .m1-box {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    min-height: 30px;\n  }\n  .m1-box.tall {\n    min-height: 60px;\n  }\n  .dotted-line {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 90%;\n    border-bottom: 1px dotted #000;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    padding-left: 0px;\n  }\n  .row-text {\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n\n  /* Schedule M-2 table */\n  .m2-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .m2-table th, .m2-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 5px 8px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .m2-table th {\n    font-weight: normal;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n  }\n  .m2-table td.desc {\n    border-left: none;\n    border-right: 1px solid #000;\n  }\n  .m2-table .num-cell {\n    width: 25px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: left;\n    border-left: none;\n  }\n  .m2-table .desc-col {\n    width: 40%;\n  }\n  .m2-firstcol {\n    border-top: none;\n    border-left: none;\n  }\n  .gray {\n    background-color: #b0b0b0;\n  }\n  .footer-form {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .footer-form b {\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"top-bar\">\n  <div>Form 1120-S (2025)</div>\n  <div>Page <span class=\"page-num\">5</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Schedule M-1 -->\n<div class=\"schedule-header\">\n  <div class=\"schedule-label\">Schedule M-1</div>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"schedule-title\">Reconciliation of Income (Loss) per Books With Income (Loss) per Return</div>\n    <div class=\"schedule-note\"><b>Note:</b> The corporation may be required to file Schedule M-3. See instructions.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"section-line\">\n\n<div class=\"m1-table\">\n  <!-- Row 1 -->\n  <div class=\"num\">1</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Net income (loss) per books &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</div>\n  <div class=\"m1-box\"></div>\n  <div class=\"num\">5</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Income recorded on books this year not included on Schedule K, lines 1 through 10 (itemize):</div>\n  <div class=\"m1-box tall\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Row 2 -->\n  <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Income included on Schedule K, lines 1, 2, 3c, 4, 5a, 6, 7, 8a, 9, and 10, not recorded on books this year (itemize): <span class=\"dotted-line\"></span><br><span class=\"dotted-line\" style=\"width:100%; margin-left:0;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"m1-box tall\"></div>\n  <div class=\"letter\">a</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Tax-exempt interest $ <span class=\"dotted-line\"></span><br><span class=\"dotted-line\" style=\"width:100%; margin-left:0;\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"m1-box\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Row 3 -->\n  <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Expenses recorded on books this year not included on Schedule K, lines 1 through 12e, and 16f (itemize):</div>\n  <div class=\"m1-box\"></div>\n  <div class=\"num\">6</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Deductions included on Schedule K, lines 1 through 12e, and 16f, not charged against book income this year (itemize):</div>\n  <div class=\"m1-box\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Row 3a -->\n  <div class=\"letter\">a</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Depreciation $ <span class=\"dotted-line\" style=\"width:70%;\"></span></div>\n  <div></div>\n  <div class=\"letter\">a</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Depreciation $ <span class=\"dotted-line\" style=\"width:70%;\"></span></div>\n  <div></div>\n\n  <!-- Row 3b -->\n  <div class=\"letter\">b</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Travel and entertainment $ <span class=\"dotted-line\" style=\"width:60%;\"></span></div>\n  <div></div>\n  <div class=\"num\">7</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Add lines 5 and 6 &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</div>\n  <div class=\"m1-box\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Row 4 -->\n  <div class=\"num\">4</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Add lines 1 through 3 &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</div>\n  <div class=\"m1-box\"></div>\n  <div class=\"num\">8</div>\n  <div class=\"row-text\">Income (loss) (Schedule K, line 18). Subtract line 7 from line 4 &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</div>\n  <div class=\"m1-box\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Schedule M-2 -->\n<div class=\"schedule-header\" style=\"margin-top:25px;\">\n  <div class=\"schedule-label\">Schedule M-2</div>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"schedule-title\">Analysis of Accumulated Adjustments Account, Shareholders' Undistributed Taxable Income Previously Taxed, Accumulated Earnings and Profits, and Other Adjustments Account</div>\n    <div class=\"schedule-note\">(see instructions)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<table class=\"m2-table\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"border:none;\"></th>\n      <th class=\"desc-col\" style=\"border:none;\"></th>\n      <th>(a) Accumulated<br>adjustments account</th>\n      <th>(b) Shareholders'<br>undistributed taxable<br>income previously taxed</th>\n      <th>(c) Accumulated<br>earnings and profits</th>\n      <th>(d) Other adjustments<br>account</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-cell\" style=\"border-top:none;\">1</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\" style=\"border-top:none;\">Balance at beginning of tax year &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-cell\">2</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\">Ordinary income from page 1, line 22 &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-cell\">3</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\">Other additions &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-cell\">4</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\">Loss from page 1, line 22 &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</td>\n      <td>( &nbsp; )</td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-cell\">5</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\">Other reductions &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</td>\n      <td>( &nbsp; )</td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n      <td class=\"gray\"></td>\n      <td>( &nbsp; )</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-cell\">6</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\">Combine lines 1 through 5 &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-cell\">7</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\">Distributions &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-cell\">8</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\">Balance at end of tax year. Subtract line 7 from line 6 &nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;.</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"footer-form\">Form <b>1120-S</b> (2025)</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
